<section id="readings" class="section readings"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / A MOMENT FOR YOU</p><h2>Choose what’s<br><em>calling to you.</em></h2></div><p>Space for your questions. Room for discovery.<br>Start with the session that feels right.</p></div><div class="reading-grid"><article class="reading-card"><span class="card-symbol" aria-hidden="true">☾</span><p class="eyebrow">LIVE · 30 MINUTES</p><h3>A moment of clarity</h3><p>A focused, personal session to explore what’s on your mind through psychic, oracle, or intuitive guidance.</p><div class="price">$30 <span>/ session</span></div><button class="button outline" data-book="thirty">Schedule 30 minutes <span>↗</span></button></article><article class="reading-card featured"><span class="card-label">MORE SPACE TO EXPLORE</span><span class="card-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><p class="eyebrow">LIVE · 60 MINUTES</p><h3>A deeper connection</h3><p>More time to follow the conversation, explore your questions, and discuss the spiritual gifts surfacing in your life.</p><div class="price">$55 <span>/ session</span></div><button class="button" data-book="hour">Schedule 60 minutes <span>↗</span></button></article><article class="reading-card"><span class="card-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✴</span><p class="eyebrow">WRITTEN · WITHIN 48 HOURS</p><h3>Three little questions</h3><p>Have something specific on your heart? Send three yes-or-no questions for a written reading from Dawn.</p><div class="price">$8 <span>/ three questions</span></div><button class="button outline" id="ask">Ask your questions <span>↗</span></button></article></div><p class="service-note">Every reading is personal. You’re welcome to bring a question—or simply your curiosity.</p></section>
<section class="about section" id="dawn"><div class="portrait-wrap"><img src="/assets/dawn.webp" alt="Dawn smiling in the sunshine" loading="lazy"><span class="portrait-caption">A WARM WELCOME, JUST AS YOU ARE.</span><span class="portrait-star" aria-hidden="true">✧</span></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE SOUL BEHIND PHOENIXRISING</p><h2>Hi, I’m Dawn.<br><em>I’m glad you’re here.</em></h2><p>I’m an oracle, psychic medium, and intuitive. Connection and compassion are at the heart of the space I want to share with you.</p><p>Claircognizance is a big part of my work. It’s that sense of simply knowing something, without a logical explanation for how you know it. Together, we can explore what comes through and what resonates with you.</p><p>Whether you’ve found me on TikTok or followed a little nudge to this page, you’re welcome here.</p><a class="text-link" href="#readings">Let’s connect <span>→</span></a><span class="signature">Dawn</span></div></section>
<section class="gifts section" id="gifts"><div class="gift-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ring ring-one"></div><div class="ring ring-two"></div><span>✧</span><small>THE KNOWING WITHIN</small></div><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / THERE’S SOMETHING WITHIN YOU</p><h2>Everyone<br><em>has gifts.</em></h2><p class="gift-quote">“If you found my page, then you have gifts that are surfacing—or have already surfaced.”</p><p>Think of your intuition like a muscle: first you pinpoint it, then you exercise it. A session can be a place to discuss and explore your own spiritual gifts, from those quiet gut feelings to moments of unexpected knowing.</p><button class="button outline" data-book="hour">Explore your gifts with Dawn <span>↗</span></button></div></section>
<section class="process section"><p class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE WAY TO BEGIN</p><h2>Your next step, <em>made easy.</em></h2><div class="steps"><div><span>01</span><h3>Follow your curiosity</h3><p>Choose a 30- or 60-minute live session, or send three yes-or-no questions.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Make space for yourself</h3><p>For a live reading, choose a time with Dawn. Bring your questions and an open mind.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Connect with Dawn</h3><p>Explore your questions together. Written readings are answered within 48 hours.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="faq section" id="questions"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE CLARITY</p><h2>Wondering<br><em>about something?</em></h2><p>Reach out to Dawn at<br><a href="mailto:dawn@dawnofthephoenix.com">dawn@dawnofthephoenix.com</a></p></div><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What is claircognizance?<span>+</span></summary><p>Claircognizance means “clear knowing”—a sense of knowing something without a logical reason or a clear source. It is one of the intuitive gifts Dawn works with and can explore with you in a session.</p></details><details><summary>Which reading should I choose?<span>+</span></summary><p>Choose 30 minutes for a focused conversation, or 60 minutes if you want more space to explore. The $8 written reading is for three specific questions that can each be answered yes or no.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to prepare anything?<span>+</span></summary><p>You can bring questions or themes you’d like to explore. For a live session, find a comfortable, quiet space. You don’t need experience with readings or spiritual practices.</p></details><details><summary>How do the three yes-or-no questions work?<span>+</span></summary><p>Send three clear questions that can be answered yes or no. The price is $8 for all three, and Dawn answers within 48 hours. The question form explains how to contact Dawn and arrange payment.</p></details><details><summary>Can we explore my own spiritual gifts?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. Dawn welcomes discussion and exploration of your gifts. Everyone has gifts; a session gives you space to begin identifying and exercising yours.</p></details><details><summary>What should I know before booking?<span>+</span></summary><p>All readings are for entertainment purposes only. They do not replace medical, mental health, legal, or financial advice. Outcomes and spiritual connections are not guaranteed. Use your own judgment when making decisions.</p></details></div></section>
